      "subject": "הסכת",
      "rationale": "Rĩĩtwa rĩa 'thiihara rĩngĩ' nĩ kũonania kĩguni kĩa kũiguithia thiĩ hatĩe mbere ya kũigĩra; Kĩhibirania kĩugaga 'ĩkĩra na ũtheri'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "to Yiceraeri",
      "rationale": "Kwarĩ o kũheania Yiceraeri ũhoro ũrĩa wa kũigĩra na kũyumbũria wa tondikĩ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "invitation",
      "subject": "Thiihara rĩngĩ, ũigĩrĩe",
      "rationale": "Cioimbũra nĩcio itũmaga mũthomi akanjia mawĩra ma kĩrĩkanĩro."
    },
    {
      "kind": "alternative",
      "subject": "mũndũ kwa Yahwe",
      "rationale": "Kĩrĩkanĩro gĩa Kĩhibirania kĩugaga 'nĩwatũire mũndũ kwa Yahwe'; gĩa kĩhĩtĩka nĩgũo 'wĩ mũndũ', no gĩteretere kĩa ũhoro nĩkĩu."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Moce na akahani a Ariũ nĩmaugire kwa Yiceraeri othe, magĩrĩra: Thiihara rĩngĩ, Yiceraeri, ũigĩrĩe; ũmũthĩ nĩwatũire mũndũ kwa Yahwe Erohimu waku.",
